WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.753
Photosynthesis converts light energy into chemical energy stored in glucose.

00:00:05.753 --> 00:00:12.987
Chlorophyll absorbs light in the chloroplasts. The light dependent reactions release oxygen.

00:00:12.987 --> 00:00:20.470
The Calvin cycle fixes carbon dioxide into sugars. It uses ATP and NADPH.


